# Build output. Any /build* directory: a session that configured into `build1/` had its
# whole 710 MB build tree swept into a merge commit on 2026-09-19 (3787 files), because
# only `/build/` and `/build-*/` were listed here.
/build*/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local scratch
/tmp/

# Editor swap files
*.swp
.*.swp

# Agent worktrees
/.claude/

# Switchboard worker scratch (rate-limit bookkeeping)
/.relay/

# Evidence runs leave these behind under docs/qa_evidence/: the worker's log lock (15 of them
# were committed on 2026-09-19) and the drivers' own intermediate screenshots.
.worker.log.lock
docs/qa_evidence/**/.share-probe.png
